0..79 Comment "//! The tasks subject\'s shared declarations, written once and imported by every"
80..160 Comment "//! source that reads them (`import \"./task-base.gandr\";`): a task forked as its"
161..240 Comment "//! parent\'s peer hands back what it found over its end. A fork is the parallel"
241..309 Comment "//! product of two strategies and an operation a move of one of them"
310..389 Comment "//! [Mellies-2020-concurrent_separation_logic_meets_template_games]; the parent"
390..465 Comment "//! joins its task by reading the end to its close, so no task outlives its"
466..534 Comment "//! parent, as no task outlives the nursery that started it in Trio."
535..538 Comment "//!"
539..615 Comment "//! - cites: [Mellies-2020-concurrent_separation_logic_meets_template_games]"
616..619 Comment "//!"
